{"applies":"vue 3.5","base":"https://vuejs.org","rows":[
["Reactivity","Use ref for primitives and objects alike","One habit keeps .value rules simple; templates unwrap it for you.","Declare with ref and read .value in script.","Mix reactive and destructured copies.","const count=ref(0); count.value++","let count=0 // not reactive","High","/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals"],
["Reactivity","Do not destructure reactive objects","Pulled-out values lose their link to the source.","Use toRefs or keep the object.","Destructure props or reactive state into plain variables.","const {a}=toRefs(state)","const {a}=state","High","/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals#limitations-of-reactive"],
["Reactivity","Use computed for derived values","Computed values are cached until a source changes.","Write a computed with no side effects.","Call a method in the template for a heavy calculation.","const total=computed(()=>items.value.reduce(add,0))","{{ calcTotal() }}","Medium","/guide/essentials/computed"],
["Reactivity","Keep computed getters pure","A getter that mutates state breaks the cache and ordering.","Return a value only.","Fetch or assign inside a computed.","computed(()=>a.value*2)","computed(()=>{b.value=1;return 2})","High","/guide/essentials/computed#getters-should-be-side-effect-free"],
["Reactivity","Watch for side effects only","watch is for requests and storage when a value changes.","Use watch or watchEffect for effects.","Sync derived state with a watcher.","watch(id,load)","watch(a,()=>b.value=a.value*2)","Medium","/guide/essentials/watchers"],
["Reactivity","Clean up watcher side effects","Cancel stale requests with onWatcherCleanup.","Register cleanup inside the callback.","Let old requests overwrite new ones.","watch(id,async(v)=>{const c=new AbortController();onWatcherCleanup(()=>c.abort());...})","watch(id,async v=>{data.value=await get(v)})","Medium","/guide/essentials/watchers#side-effect-cleanup"],
["Templates","Always key v-for","A stable key lets Vue move rows instead of patching them.","Key by id.","Use index when order can change.","<li v-for='i in items' :key='i.id'>","<li v-for='(i,n) in items' :key='n'>","High","/guide/essentials/list#maintaining-state-with-key"],
["Templates","Do not combine v-for and v-if on one element","v-if has higher priority and cannot see the loop variable.","Filter with a computed or wrap in template.","Put both on the same node.","<template v-for='i in shown' :key='i.id'>","<li v-for='i in items' v-if='i.ok'>","High","/guide/essentials/list#v-for-with-v-if"],
["Templates","Use v-show for frequent toggles","v-show flips CSS; v-if mounts and unmounts.","v-show for toggles; v-if for rarely true.","v-if on a tab toggled every second.","<p v-show='open'>","<p v-if='open'>","Low","/guide/essentials/conditional#v-if-vs-v-show"],
["Templates","Never render untrusted HTML","v-html inserts markup unescaped, which allows XSS.","Use text interpolation or sanitise.","Bind user input to v-html.","<p>{{ comment }}</p>","<p v-html='comment'></p>","Critical","/guide/best-practices/security#xss"],
["Templates","Avoid user-controlled URLs and templates","Sanitise links before binding to href; never compile user strings as templates.","Allow only http, https, mailto, tel.","Bind javascript: URLs.","<a :href='safeUrl(u)'>","<a :href='userUrl'>","Critical","/guide/best-practices/security"],
["Components","Declare props with types","Typed props document the contract and warn in dev.","Use defineProps with a type.","Read attrs untyped.","const p=defineProps<{title:string}>()","const p=defineProps(['title'])","Medium","/guide/components/props"],
["Components","Do not mutate props","Data flows down; ask the parent through events.","Emit an update event.","Assign to a prop.","emit('update',v)","props.items.push(x)","High","/guide/components/props#one-way-data-flow"],
["Components","Declare emits","Declared events are documented and not treated as native listeners.","Use defineEmits.","Emit undeclared names.","const emit=defineEmits<{save:[id:number]}>()","this.$emit('x')","Low","/guide/components/events"],
["Components","Use defineModel for v-model","3.4+ lets a component expose two-way binding simply.","Call defineModel.","Write prop plus emit by hand.","const v=defineModel<string>()","props.modelValue + emit('update:modelValue')","Low","/guide/components/v-model"],
["Components","Compose with slots","Slots keep a component flexible without prop explosion.","Provide named slots.","Add a boolean for each variant.","<slot name='footer'/>","<Card :showFooter='true' :footerText='x'/>","Low","/guide/components/slots"],
["Components","Use provide and inject for deep values","It avoids long prop chains for theme or config.","Provide a ref; inject with a default.","Pass through 6 levels of props.","provide('theme',theme)","<A :theme><B :theme><C :theme>","Low","/guide/components/provide-inject"],
["Components","Use a multi-word component name","Avoid clashing with HTML elements.","Name BookingForm.","Name it Form.","BookingForm.vue","Form.vue","Low","/style-guide/rules-essential"],
["Composables","Extract reusable logic into composables","Composables share stateful logic across components.","Name useX and return refs.","Copy logic across files.","export function useBooking(){return {slots,book}}","// duplicated","Medium","/guide/reusability/composables"],
["Composables","Call composables synchronously in setup","Lifecycle hooks must register during setup.","Call at the top of script setup.","Call after await or in handlers.","const {x}=useX()","onMounted(()=>useX())","Medium","/guide/reusability/composables#usage-restrictions"],
["Lifecycle","Use onMounted for browser APIs","DOM and window exist only after mount.","Touch DOM in onMounted.","Use window in setup during SSR.","onMounted(()=>measure())","const w=window.innerWidth","High","/api/composition-api-lifecycle"],
["Lifecycle","Remove listeners in onUnmounted","Global listeners and timers outlive the component.","Pair add and remove.","Add and forget.","onUnmounted(()=>removeEventListener('resize',f))","addEventListener('resize',f)","High","/api/composition-api-lifecycle"],
["Refs","Use template refs after mount","Refs are null until the element exists.","useTemplateRef and read in onMounted.","Read the ref in setup top level.","const el=useTemplateRef('box')","el.value.focus() // in setup","Medium","/guide/essentials/template-refs"],
["Performance","Lazy-load route components","Dynamic imports split the bundle.","Use import() in routes.","Import every page statically.","component:()=>import('./Menu.vue')","import Menu from './Menu.vue'","High","https://router.vuejs.org/guide/advanced/lazy-loading"],
["Performance","defineAsyncComponent for heavy widgets","Load maps and editors only when shown.","Wrap with defineAsyncComponent.","Import eagerly.","const Map=defineAsyncComponent(()=>import('./Map.vue'))","import Map from './Map.vue'","Medium","/guide/components/async"],
["Performance","Use shallowRef for big read-only data","Deep reactivity on huge objects costs time.","shallowRef for large lists replaced wholesale.","ref on a 10k-item array of rich objects.","const rows=shallowRef([])","const rows=ref(big)","Medium","/guide/best-practices/performance#reduce-reactivity-overhead-for-large-immutable-structures"],
["Performance","Virtualise long lists","Rendering thousands of rows is slow.","Use a virtual scroller.","v-for over 10000 rows.","<RecycleScroller :items='rows'>","<li v-for='r in rows'>","Medium","/guide/best-practices/performance#virtualize-large-lists"],
["Performance","Keep props stable","A changing prop re-renders the child.","Pass booleans, not whole objects, when only a flag matters.","Pass an object that changes each tick.","<Item :active='id===activeId'/>","<Item :activeId='activeId'/>","Low","/guide/best-practices/performance#update-optimizations"],
["Performance","Use KeepAlive for tabs that keep state","It caches component instances between switches.","Wrap dynamic components.","Rebuild expensive tabs each time.","<KeepAlive><component :is='tab'/></KeepAlive>","<component :is='tab'/>","Low","/guide/built-ins/keep-alive"],
["Performance","Use v-once and v-memo rarely","They skip updates for static or memoised subtrees.","Use after measuring.","Sprinkle everywhere.","<div v-once>{{ big }}</div>","// v-memo on all","Low","/api/built-in-directives#v-memo"],
["Performance","Watch the build size","Tree-shake and import named exports.","Check the bundle report.","Pull a whole UI kit.","import {debounce} from 'lodash-es'","import _ from 'lodash'","Medium","/guide/best-practices/performance#bundle-size-and-tree-shaking"],
["Forms","Bind inputs with v-model","Handles text, checkbox, radio and select.","Use v-model with the right type.","Wire value and input events by hand.","<input v-model.trim='name'>","<input :value='name' @input='...'>","Low","/guide/essentials/forms"],
["Forms","Label every control","Visible labels help everyone (SC 1.3.1, 3.3.2).","Use for/id pairs via useId.","Placeholder-only.","<label :for='id'>Phone</label><input :id='id' type='tel' autocomplete='tel'>","<input placeholder='Phone'>","Critical","/guide/best-practices/accessibility#forms"],
["Forms","Prevent default with .prevent","Handle submit without reloading.","Use @submit.prevent.","Call preventDefault by hand.","<form @submit.prevent='send'>","<form onsubmit='...'>","Low","/guide/essentials/event-handling#event-modifiers"],
["Forms","Show submit state","Disable the button while sending and say what is happening.","Track a pending ref.","Allow repeat clicks.","<button :disabled='pending'>Book a visit</button>","<button>Submit</button>","High","/guide/essentials/forms"],
["Forms","Link errors to fields","Use aria-describedby and aria-invalid (SC 3.3.1).","Render the message beside the input.","Colour only.","<input :aria-invalid='!!err' aria-describedby='e1'><p id='e1'>{{err}}</p>","<input :class='{red:err}'>","High","/guide/best-practices/accessibility#forms"],
["Forms","Booking form: ask for little","Name, phone, preferred time; the button names the result.","Keep to needed fields.","Eight optional fields.","<button>Request a callback</button>","<button>Submit</button>","Medium","/guide/essentials/forms"],
["Accessibility","Skip link","A first link jumps to main (SC 2.4.1).","Add skip link and landmarks.","None.","<a href='#main' class='skip'>Skip to content</a>","<div id='app'>","High","/guide/best-practices/accessibility#skip-link"],
["Accessibility","Use landmarks and headings in order","Structure supports navigation (SC 1.3.1).","header, nav, main, footer; h1 once.","Style divs as headings.","<main><h1>Plumbing</h1>","<div class='h1'>","High","/guide/best-practices/accessibility#landmarks"],
["Accessibility","Move focus on route changes","SPAs must tell users the view changed.","Focus the main heading after navigation.","Leave focus on a vanished link.","router.afterEach(()=>h1.value?.focus())","// none","High","/guide/best-practices/accessibility"],
["Accessibility","Click-to-call is an anchor","tel links are announced as links and work on phones.","Use a with tel.","Click handler on a button.","<a href='tel:+15555550123'>Call 555-0123</a>","<button @click='dial'>","High","/guide/best-practices/accessibility"],
["Accessibility","Alt text for images","SC 1.1.1.","Describe purpose.","Missing alt.","<img :src='p' alt='Plumber fitting a tap' width='640' height='400'>","<img :src='p'>","Critical","/guide/best-practices/accessibility#images"],
["Accessibility","Respect reduced motion in Transition","Large movement can cause harm (SC 2.3.3).","Zero or soften transitions in the media query.","Always slide.",".fade-enter-active{transition:opacity .2s} @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.fade-enter-active{transition:none}}",".slide{transition:transform 1s}","High","/guide/built-ins/transition"],
["Accessibility","Use real buttons","Keyboard and role come for free (SC 4.1.2).","Button for actions.","div with @click.","<button @click='open'>Menu</button>","<div @click='open'>Menu</div>","Critical","/guide/best-practices/accessibility"],
["State","Use Pinia for shared state","It is the official store, with devtools and SSR support.","Define stores with setup syntax.","Hand-roll a global reactive module for SSR apps.","export const useCart=defineStore('cart',()=>{const items=ref([]);return {items}})","export const state=reactive({})","Medium","https://pinia.vuejs.org/core-concepts/"],
["State","Do not destructure store state","Destructuring breaks reactivity.","Use storeToRefs.","const {items}=store.","const {items}=storeToRefs(store)","const {items}=store","High","https://pinia.vuejs.org/core-concepts/#Destructuring-from-a-Store"],
["SSR","Avoid cross-request state","Singletons on the server leak data between users.","Create the app and stores per request.","Share a module-level store.","createSSRApp(App)","const app=createApp(App) // shared","Critical","/guide/scaling-up/ssr#cross-request-state-pollution"],
["SSR","Match server and client markup","Mismatches force full client rendering.","Move browser-only values to onMounted.","Render Date.now.","onMounted(()=>t.value=Date.now())","{{ Date.now() }}","High","/guide/scaling-up/ssr#hydration-mismatch"],
